From 3efbee12ae8c572ed492ed41372ec99754e4e5c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: small-gear-lab <289302950+marie-222@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:12:49 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Show animated GIFs and SVG images

GIFs keep all their frames (up to 512 MB) with their delays; the frame to
draw follows the time, and the renderer reports that it is animating so the
next frame is drawn. paused and frame stop the animation at a frame.
SVG files are rasterized with resvg (longer side 4096 px, system fonts).
